# Task 15 Task 12 (spec section 20): reference Caddy reverse-proxy config
# for LinuxLab Central. Caddy is the Phase 1 reference reverse proxy
# (ADR-008); Gunicorn is never exposed directly to the Internet.
#
# Central production traffic is HTTPS. Using a real hostname (rather than a
# bare ":port" address) makes Caddy provision and renew TLS certificates
# automatically -- replace central.example.org with the real public
# hostname for the deployment.

central.example.org {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8000
}
